  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcDashboard .NET: the dashboard layout, tiles and KPI cards for WinForms, WPF and Avalonia. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. Runtime drag and resize, SaveLayout / LoadLayout, cross-filtering, the runtime designer and the sgcWebSockets bridge are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
